: 1236086}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72871, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9763, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 769813, "username": "guanxue", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/guanxue", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_mini.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_normal.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_large.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_xlarge.png?m=1784598662", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/55a5/5aa6/769813_xxlarge.png?m=1784598662", "created": 1760103541, "last_modified": 1784598662, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "wangxiaoer", "last_touched": 1787343782, "title": "请教下各位用的都是什么梯子订阅", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236097", "created": 1787281444, "deleted": 0, "content": "现在 AI 火爆，随之而来就是对梯子稳定/延迟的考验，目前已经试过闪电/大机场/冲浪猫/Bocchi/追云，其中闪电和大机场年订阅 260 ，延迟略高但平稳，稳定一般（一天内会偶现 Timeout ）;冲浪猫/Bocchi 可以按流量/年订阅选择，价格一百左右够用，延迟略低但波动，稳定略强（两三天会偶现 Timeout ）;追云是便宜延迟低但稳定较差（一天内可能几次 Timeout ）。\r\n\r\n想了解下各位的梯子用的哪些，可以分享带邀请码的，简单说明下价格/延迟/波动等情况，以及设备限制/速率等。", "content_rendered": "<p>现在 AI 火爆，随之而来就是对梯子稳定/延迟的考验，目前已经试过闪电/大机场/冲浪猫/Bocchi/追云，其中闪电和大机场年订阅 260 ，延迟略高但平稳，稳定一般（一天内会偶现 Timeout ）;冲浪猫/Bocchi 可以按流量/年订阅选择，价格一百左右够用，延迟略低但波动，稳定略强（两三天会偶现 Timeout ）;追云是便宜延迟低但稳定较差（一天内可能几次 Timeout ）。</p>\n<p>想了解下各位的梯子用的哪些，可以分享带邀请码的，简单说明下价格/延迟/波动等情况，以及设备限制/速率等。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787281444, "replies": 93, "id": 1236097}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 72871, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9763, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 499495, "username": "Ayanokouji", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Ayanokouji", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_mini.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_normal.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_large.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_xlarge.png?m=1773811031", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9075/dfdb/499495_xxlarge.png?m=1773811031", "created": 1594909971, "last_modified": 1773811031, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "sn0wdr1am", "last_touched": 1787363525, "title": "你们会骂 AI 吗", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236083", "created": 1787279527, "deleted": 0, "content": "遇到需求理解错误跑偏，牛头不对马嘴的时候，我都是重开一个回话，重新整理提示词。和 AI 对骂又解决不了问题。", "content_rendered": "遇到需求理解错误跑偏，牛头不对马嘴的时候，我都是重开一个回话，重新整理提示词。和 AI 对骂又解决不了问题。", "last_modified": 1787279527, "replies": 91, "id": 1236083}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4545, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3301, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 477906, "username": "lgc931018", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/lgc931018", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_mini.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_normal.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_large.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xlarge.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xxlarge.png?m=1787193962", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_xxxlarge.png?m=1787193962", "created": 1584718940, "last_modified": 1787193962, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Kimipoker", "last_touched": 1787323612, "title": "刚刚看到 Tibo 说 Codex 额度用的太快是 sub2api 的问题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236151", "created": 1787291148, "deleted": 0, "content": "不知道大家在用 sub2api 的是不是最近会有问题 \r\n我是两个 pro 20 反代了半年多 \r\n昨天重置前是出现了额度消耗很快 \r\n我还以为是我开了 fast 和最近没有 rest 的原因", "content_rendered": "<p>不知道大家在用 sub2api 的是不是最近会有问题\n我是两个 pro 20 反代了半年多\n昨天重置前是出现了额度消耗很快\n我还以为是我开了 fast 和最近没有 rest 的原因</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787291148, "replies": 75, "id": 1236151}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_large.png?m=1768280127", "name": "career", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24146, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3729, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 221751, "username": "tht1286545749", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/tht1286545749", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "前端 - 全栈 - agent - 项目管理", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_mini.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_normal.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_large.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xlarge.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xxlarge.png?m=1785396673", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11a3/7af8/221751_xxxlarge.png?m=1785396673", "created": 1489848211, "last_modified": 1785396673, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "pldxx", "last_touched": 1787328517, "title": "我们开始倒班考勤了", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236064", "created": 1787278088, "deleted": 0, "content": "没想到程序员也开始轮班了。\r\n\r\nAI 时代，倒班真的来了。\r\n\r\n由于智谱、DeepSeek 都实行高峰期 Token 翻倍策略，公司为了节约 Token 成本，本周起开始实行新考勤制度：\r\n\r\n非周末休息一天，周末再休息一天，可自由组合，但需要提前排班。\r\n\r\n与此同时，工作日作息也调整为 14:00 以后再午休。\r\n\r\nAI 不一定先抢走我的工作，\r\n但它已经开始决定我什么时候上班、什么时候休息了。\r\nAI 时代的一粒尘埃，落到了我的身上。", "content_rendered": "没想到程序员也开始轮班了。<br /><br />AI 时代，倒班真的来了。<br /><br />由于智谱、DeepSeek 都实行高峰期 Token 翻倍策略，公司为了节约 Token 成本，本周起开始实行新考勤制度：<br /><br />非周末休息一天，周末再休息一天，可自由组合，但需要提前排班。<br /><br />与此同时，工作日作息也调整为 14:00 以后再午休。<br /><br />AI 不一定先抢走我的工作，<br />但它已经开始决定我什么时候上班、什么时候休息了。<br />AI 时代的一粒尘埃，落到了我的身上。", "last_modified": 1787283934, "replies": 65, "id": 1236064}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11537, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2447, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 722743, "username": "jayhuang0044", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/jayhuang0044", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4f225488e3ee5f579fbce8e7e3c7ef32?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4f225488e3ee5f579fbce8e7e3c7ef32?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4f225488e3ee5f579fbce8e7e3c7ef32?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1732872251, "last_modified": 1763707848, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "lanxisama", "last_touched": 1787363964, "title": "大家对最近的 12306 两人三张票三座 怎么看,个人反对!", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236273", "created": 1787309935, "deleted": 0, "content": "补充:\r\n按照国家有关规定，实行车票实名制的，列车验票时，同时核对旅客、所持车票及购票时所使用的有效身份证件原件。票、证、人不一致，按无票处理。\r\n\r\n无坐票,无固定座位票\r\n\r\n经济厢车票,应该是有国家对票价的补贴吧.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n核心:购票者没有上车,没在车上现场的情况, 票有没有效 座有没有所属.", "content_rendered": "<p>补充:\n按照国家有关规定，实行车票实名制的，列车验票时，同时核对旅客、所持车票及购票时所使用的有效身份证件原件。票、证、人不一致，按无票处理。</p>\n<p>无坐票,无固定座位票</p>\n<p>经济厢车票,应该是有国家对票价的补贴吧.</p>\n<p>核心:购票者没有上车,没在车上现场的情况, 票有没有效 座有没有所属.</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787309935, "replies": 57, "id": 1236273}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_large.png?m=1630643913", "name": "apple", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_normal.png?m=1630643913", "title": "Apple", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/apple", "topics": 30982, "footer": "", "header": "设计了 <a href=\"/go/watch\">Apple Watch</a>，<a href=\"/go/ipad\">iPad</a>，<a href=\"/go/iphone\">iPhone</a>，<a href=\"/go/imac\">iMac</a> 及 <a href=\"/go/mbp\">MacBook Pro</a> 等电子产品的美国公司。", "title_alternative": "Apple", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6cdd/60ea/184_mini.png?m=1630643913", "stars": 3340, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 184, "parent_node_name": "hardware"}, "member": {"id": 537477, "username": "csfreshman", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/csfreshman", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7624630ff4f2bad517fe23a0f81daf6b?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1615691429, "last_modified": 1749122721, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "haogre", "last_touched": 1787344522, "title": "苹果 9 月初 iphone18 发布会， iphone17 会降价？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1236071", "created": 1787278620, "deleted": 0, "content": "手持 iphone11 ，有点顶不住了。\r\n\r\n现在纠结的是等 iphone18 发布后买 iphone17 还是直接入手？\r\n\r\n另外给家人买手机用过国补了，是不是需要找其它今年不换机的人用下国补名额？", "content_rendered": "<p>手持 iphone11 ，有点顶不住了。</p>\n<p>现在纠结的是等 iphone18 发布后买 iphone17 还是直接入手？</p>\n<p>另外给家人买手机用过国补了，是不是需要找其它今年不换机的人用下国补名额？</p>\n", "last_modified": 1787278620, "replies": 52, "id": 1236071}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_normal.png?m=1751736785", "title": "OpenAI", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai", "topics": 4545, "footer": "", "header": "关于 OpenAI 旗下产品 GPT，DALL·E，和 ChatGPT 的讨论。请不要在 V2EX 的回复中粘贴复制来自 AI 生成的文本。", "title_alternative": "OpenAI", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785", "stars": 3301, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1135, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 333180, "username": "Gitya", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Gitya", "website": nu